      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIWI GEORGE (5) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when second (28.19) over 500m at Bendigo. Well placed and gets his chance. WESTSIDE WIZARD (6) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (23.26) in a Grade 5 at Warragul. Form at the trip sound including eight wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from seven attempts. Should be about the money. BOMB OVER (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (30.75) in a Grade 5 at The Meadows. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. SPANISH ARMADA (1) is sure to play a big role again after nice run of wins.",
